// P5: negative indices.
// i ranges over [-2, 2], array size 3. Concrete runs with i < 0 fault with a
// negative-index OOB; runs with i >= 3 do not occur here.  The analysis must
// report the negative-index possibility (interval unknown is not safe) and
// must not claim an always-too-large index.
input i;
arr a[3] = [7, 8, 9];
var x = 0;
x = a[i];
